# Service definition to re-read every dynamic parameter's feature from the camera and update
# the node's parameters to match, without writing anything back. Needed after a command
# feature (e.g. 'FocusAuto') changes camera state that the node otherwise only knows from
# what it last wrote.

---

# flag indicating if every feature could be read
bool is_successful

# names of the parameters whose value changed
string[] changed
